{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>年度動漫盛事，香港動漫電玩節今日（24/7）於灣仔香港會議展覽中心重磅登場！雖然天氣炎熱，但絲毫減退不了動漫迷與玩家們的熱情。現場一大早便人頭湧湧，會展場內場外均擠得水泄不通，盛況空前！</p><figure><img alt=\"人頭湧湧。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157368738832584704706231.jpeg/SwrbKGun4BGxQrPTbBJ-fKFRVf5gEc1GsqqR4YeqkeE\"/><figcaption>人頭湧湧。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人頭湧湧。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157367546148950016319682.jpeg/9u59_OEp2yJM896YnWwgWARQlj6X3EEhjbHWsbix1rE\"/><figcaption>人頭湧湧。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盛況空前！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157367543770648576298467.jpeg/e5mWsHosPR1GUBjsR0I8tY9HW1JGVHXFanfWfl931n4\"/><figcaption>盛況空前！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"盛況空前！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157366933088112640957408.jpeg/04SByFAn230S2cvz6IlS_pniI_Gc_YJL8wtzh8YLc4c\"/><figcaption>盛況空前！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><p>展區萬人空巷 閃光燈閃不停</p><p>今日一開門，萬千動漫迷即蜂擁而至，場內各個熱門展區及同人攤位瞬間排起長龍。除了精彩的電玩體驗、限量周邊商品搶購外，全場最矚目的焦點莫過於一眾精心打扮的 Cosplayer！無論是熱門動漫《One Piece》的航海士「娜美」、高冷美艷的性感女警、粉紅兔女郎，還是甜美打卡比心的黑系美少女，各大角色紛紛「破壁」走進現實。</p><figure><img alt=\"娜美！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157366935902621696764529.jpeg/E13DWTt5ZSXaj3MUGmdRvsMd0eWgk3ADpe-W95Dvlvc\"/><figcaption>娜美！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感又可愛的警花Coser。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157366779480117248218073.jpeg/VQOvalzM4iGOSimJzvjLcKAjzdW_83cgvwJbaooCW2o\"/><figcaption>性感又可愛的警花Coser。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感又可愛的警花Coser。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157367541375569920318506.jpeg/f-D-SzHejD0Z1gPfZSiu8Ud9agJSWF_pZr78wFO-_MA\"/><figcaption>性感又可愛的警花Coser。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"粉紅兔女郎！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157365746675093504438170.jpeg/LNlkapg-H8xL80pw0h-WAKgN9DlaPYBmN7GZAAKxmQA\"/><figcaption>粉紅兔女郎！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"粉紅兔女郎！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157365744737193984931627.jpeg/PAAnajwlQlFWX_Oj6Qsxtx4k_SSIvZ6-JP0m2xH9Jts\"/><figcaption>粉紅兔女郎！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黑色漆皮套裝Coser對着鏡頭比心，甜度超標。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157366943360487424398572.jpeg/lGY0nSFv5_EQtYI1Ejr1atI2F2VYOXAnqQWbUJwFm1A\"/><figcaption>黑色漆皮套裝Coser對着鏡頭比心，甜度超標。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黑色漆皮套裝Coser對着鏡頭比心，甜度超標。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157368736533975040103275.jpeg/GjzHVi_fika7tk60jW8FgNcMCQHufcWrhWU0mr9lNJo\"/><figcaption>黑色漆皮套裝Coser對着鏡頭比心，甜度超標。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批攝影發燒友持長焦大炮圍觀拍攝Coser。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157367539047600128759308.jpeg/nYU-igV7SzgydQVbc0wA6UQgDGvzcrY1hQc-oLMHPqA\"/><figcaption>大批攝影發燒友持長焦大炮圍觀拍攝Coser。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><p>Coser悉心裝扮 長槍短炮包圍成「人牆」</p><p>今年場內的Cosplay質素極高，每位Coser無論是服裝細節、髮型妝容以至角色神態均還原度極高，不論是火辣造型、可愛風還是御姐範，每一位都擺出專屬招牌Pose，展現強大氣場。現場隨處可見被批大批攝影師「重重包圍」的盛況，攝影發燒友紛紛掏出專業長鏡頭、補光燈，閃光燈此起起伏，鎂光燈聲響個不停，氣氛熱烈如大型明星發布會！</p><figure><img alt=\"質素極高！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157365792350801920905638.jpeg/CCT4PVJnysiaMnjmBTLF-QfKdKK9AKo23GozQuVqM0I\"/><figcaption>質素極高！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"質素極高！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157365749065977856913475.jpeg/QjI_6EKA1Xz62QAqF7FzT1FimTVYJrANHB6kkykepJM\"/><figcaption>質素極高！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"還原度極高！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157366938121539584659130.jpeg/zJwi5PLUhD2eE9iZy1N1rxtPdqtCRzq-XcIp5GTCKeQ\"/><figcaption>還原度極高！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"還原度極高！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157366941082849280142957.jpeg/E31VDf5C7zpeZA0RXEy_Eky67VgLe3_6nYg0naSINJ0\"/><figcaption>還原度極高！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"閃光燈閃不停！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157365742572802048865730.jpeg/SLMus9Nn5Q2jlSEppFahR3TfAmVVtaMKqz2zFZ49sxU\"/><figcaption>閃光燈閃不停！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"閃光燈閃不停！（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157365740416798720627389.jpeg/1jJ6Mnt4wCZIBNLa5RRTqUQw5BrpkYBFlpjCvKOYwrw\"/><figcaption>閃光燈閃不停！（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批攝影發燒友持長焦大炮圍觀拍攝Coser。（葉志明攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260724/1157365790047997952869471.jpeg/oVE7AEcUxjPZ3Tx-DImwoKMAkATJvvChuE700Y1O9NE\"/><figcaption>大批攝影發燒友持長焦大炮圍觀拍攝Coser。（葉志明攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T09:40:41.714903+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":772,"images":19,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}